---
import Life from '../../layouts/Life.astro';
---

<Life title="life — Kanishk Sigar" description="Writing, books, and the things that are not projects.">

  <p>this is what i think about after i close a book.</p>

  <p>
    mostly the same few writers. dostoevsky, kafka, camus, rooney. i don't have
    an unusual library. i just spend a long time in it.
  </p>

  <p>sometimes the thinking wanders off the page and into ordinary things.</p>

  <nav class="rooms">
    <span class="room room--soon">
      <span class="room-name">writing</span>
      <span class="room-note">notes, essays, marginalia — soon</span>
    </span>
    <span class="room room--soon">
      <span class="room-name">the shelf</span>
      <span class="room-note">what i've read, and what i haven't — soon</span>
    </span>
    <span class="room room--soon">
      <span class="room-name">watching</span>
      <span class="room-note">soon</span>
    </span>
  </nav>

</Life>

<style>
  .rooms {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 34px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .room {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .room-name { font-size: 19px; }

  .room-note {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-align: right;
  }

  .room--soon .room-name { color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
